## User Flow: Visitor Journey (New Homepage)

```mermaid
graph TD
    V[Visitor lands on homepage] --> H[Hero: Rental messaging + Search]

    H --> |searches equipment| S[EquipmentSearch results]
    S --> |clicks result| SUB[Subcategory page]
    SUB --> |adds to cart| Q[Cotizador]

    H --> |browses categories| CG[CategoryShowcase grid]
    CG --> |clicks subcategory pill| SUB
    CG --> |clicks Ver categoría| CAT[Category page]
    CAT --> |browses equipment| SUB

    H --> |scrolls down| FE[FeaturedEquipment carousel]
    FE --> |clicks Cotizar| Q

    H --> |scrolls more| TR[Trust signals: stats + logos]
    TR --> SC[Services compact links]
    SC --> |clicks service| SP[Service detail page]

    H --> |scrolls to bottom| CTA[CTA Band: Cotiza tu equipo]
    CTA --> |Ir al cotizador| Q
    CTA --> |WhatsApp| WA[WhatsApp chat]

    Q --> |submits quote| DONE[Quote sent via WhatsApp]
```

## Data Flow

