    ST[site.ts] --> |navigationData| NAV[Navigation]
    ST --> |footerData| FTR[Footer]
    ST --> |featuredEquipment| FE
    ST --> |siteBrand| META[Meta tags]

    EC[EquipmentCard] --> |rendered by| FE
